# The death test map (T6.12, RouteTestMaps) on Ultra-Violence with
# monsters: the player backs east over the shotgun, the blue armor and the
# blue keycard, facing west, and stands there while two imps and a
# zombieman (east) kill it (tic 686). Dead (P_DeathThink), its weapon goes
# on lowering, its view falls to 6 units and it turns 5 degrees a tic
# towards its killer, the damage flash fading only once it faces it. Then
# use (held 3 tics: the reborn player's usedown keeps it from using
# anything) reborns it: the level reloads (G_DoReborn, ga_loadlevel) and
# the player starts afresh (G_PlayerReborn: pistol, 50 bullets, no armor,
# no keys; the level's counts cleared), backs east over the pickups again
# and waits.
iwad testmap
map death
skill 4
monsters
# forwardmove sidemove turn buttons [xcount]; turn << 8 = angleturn
-25 0 0 0 x14
0 0 0 0 x746
0 0 0 2 x3
-25 0 0 0 x14
0 0 0 0 x40
